Third-party level data attribution
===================================

levels/ (gitignored, never committed to this repo) is populated by
scripts/fetch-levelsets.sh from the LBreakoutHD project:

  Source:  https://github.com/midzer/lbreakouthd
  Commit:  3cd2a6160941557f48c49b184f0ad47ddd882c23 (v1.1.8)
  License: GNU GPLv3 (see the project's own COPYING file)

This repo is MIT-licensed; the fetched levelset data is GPL and is
never committed here -- levels/ is gitignored. This file exists to
credit the original levelset authors as required by the GPL, without
reproducing any of their level data.

The 'Arkanoid' levelset (a fan recreation of the original
Taito Arkanoid brick layouts) is deliberately excluded from the fetch
and never touches this repo, even in the gitignored levels/ directory.

